WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.753
The Ted Lasso welcome wagon has
arrived!

00:00:02.753 --> 00:00:04.129
(All)
Ted!

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:07.090
♪♪

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:13.096
(Crowd noise)

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:18.060
(Punt)
(Crowd) -Aww.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.105
♪♪

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.857
Lloyd:
So, you're heavily favored this
weekend? 

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.610
Do you think this will
end your embarrassing streak of
draws?

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.363
Lloyd, I've never been
embarrassed about having streaks
in my drawers.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:30.572
Ted:
You know, it's all part of
growing up.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.825
♪ Pressure pushing down on me ♪

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:34.826
Ted:
I've got a question for you.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:37.120
Has a team, guy like us, ever
won the whole chimichanga?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.330
-Not for forty years.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.706
Ooh!

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.833
Oh, we're coming in through
here.
-That's fine. Yeah, I got ya.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:42.834
It's like Dukes of Hazzards.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:46.296
-Hahaha.
Y'all probably call it the
Earls of Risk over here.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:50.175
♪ It's the terror of knowing
what this world is about ♪

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.176
We've got work to do.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:53.762
♪ Watching some good friends
screaming let me out ♪

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.597
I think it's time for
these young fellas to meet,

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:56.598
Ted:
that guy.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.684
Oh no, Led Tasso.

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:01.603
♪♪

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.522
Aagh!
-(Whistle blows)

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:04.856
Alright you little turd-birds.

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:06.733
Start touching your toes.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.819
Now touch each other's toes.

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:10.153
(All)
-What?

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.613
(Clap-clap)
-How long was I out?

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:13.532
Not as long as last time,
but nobody was hurt.

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:14.491
Okay.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:18.453
♪ Why can't we give ourselves
one more chance ♪

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:20.122
People saying there's something
wrong with us.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:21.540
Ted:
Not the way I see it.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.250
Ted:
I believe in Communism.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.168
Rom-communism that is.

00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:26.628
Ted:
If Tom Hanks and Meg Ryan,

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:28.880
Ted:
can go through some heartfelt
struggles and still

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.923
Ted:
end up happy.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.924
Ted:
Then, so can we.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.261
♪ Caring about ourselves ♪

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:35.262
Woo-hoo!

00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:36.430
♪ This is ♪

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.556
(Growling sound)

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:38.765
♪o ur last dance ♪

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.392
This is our turn to make
history.

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:41.727
And I believe we're gonna do
just that.

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:42.728
♪ Last dance ♪

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:43.729
(All)
-Yeah!

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:44.771
♪ This is our last dance ♪  

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.148
To the family we're born with...

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:48.317
Higgins:
and to families you make along
the way.

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:49.318
To Richmond!

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:51.486
♪ To ourselves ♪

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:52.696
♪ Under pressure ♪

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:55.365
Alright, let's go kick their
butts.

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:57.576
Butts on 3.
-Works for me. 
1-2-3. 

00:01:57.576 --> 00:01:58.577
(All)
-Butts!

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.370
♪♪

